&lt;li&gt;Solutions-oriented, can-do attitude and high energy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable and able to function in an ambiguous, fast paced, high pressure environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and able to prioritise and deliver quality outputs under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable and able to function in an ambiguous, fast paced, high pressure environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
